Subject: [PATCH] migration(showcase-bank-shot) step 12: mountHud tabletop +
 aim-drag touch

Deletes the #hud/#panel markup (stat grid, power meter, controls list, evidence strip, brand blurb, action buttons) for the shared HUD kit: clock/score/combo/objective/prompt/strike-meter on the tabletop theme; aim-drag touch drives the same manualHeld codes the keyboard path reads.

